#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:100
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardware and board support"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:102
msgid "**Arduino GIGA** — HM01B0 / HM0360 sensor support; Open-AMP dual-core."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino GIGA** — dukungan sensor HM01B0 / HM0360; Open-AMP dual-core."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:103
msgid ""
"**Bluetooth** — CYW43 BT firmware on Nicla Vision, Portenta H7, and GIGA."
msgstr ""
"**Bluetooth** — firmware BT CYW43 pada Nicla Vision, Portenta H7, dan GIGA."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:104
msgid "**Portenta H7** — Open-AMP M7/M4 RPMsg."
msgstr "**Portenta H7** — Open-AMP M7/M4 RPMsg."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:105
msgid "**OpenMV RT1060** — additional GC heap blocks (more Python memory)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV RT1060** — blok heap GC tambahan (lebih banyak memori Python)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:108
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Breaking API changes"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:110
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v4.5.5 and v4.5.6. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan API yang terlihat pengguna antara v4.5.5 dan v4.5.6. Cakupan: "
"modul C Python dalam ``modules/`` dan pustaka Python dalam "
"``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:113
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Setiap perubahan diberi tag dengan dampaknya:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:115
msgid "*major* — most scripts that used it need edits."
msgstr "*major* — sebagian besar skrip yang menggunakannya perlu diedit."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:116
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts that used it."
msgstr "*minor* — API sempit; hanya memengaruhi skrip yang menggunakannya."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:117
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr ""
"*behavior* — API sama, hasil berbeda; periksa ulang skrip yang disetel."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:118
msgid "*tooling* — affects dual-core / board mechanisms, not the Python API."
msgstr ""
"*tooling* — memengaruhi mekanisme dual-core / papan, bukan API Python."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:120
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v4_5_6_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan dikelompokkan berdasarkan dampak dalam urutan tersebut. Jika Anda "
"hanya ingin memindahkan kode, langsung ke :ref:`daftar periksa migrasi "
"<v4_5_6_migration>` di akhir. Setiap hash commit menautkan ke diff-nya di "
"GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:127
msgid "``tf`` module replaced by the :mod:`ml` package *(major)*"
msgstr "Modul ``tf`` digantikan oleh paket :mod:`ml` *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:129
msgid ""
"The TensorFlow ``tf`` C module was rewritten into an engine-agnostic "
":mod:`ml` package (``tf`` is kept as a backwards-compatible alias, but new "
"code should use :mod:`ml`). The module-level functions ``tf.load``, "
"``tf.load_builtin_model`` and the ``detect()``/``segment()``/classification "
"methods were removed — construct a :class:`ml.Model` and call ``predict()``."
" ``ml.Model(path)`` now returns just the model (no ``(labels, model)`` "
"tuple); labels are a ``model.labels`` attribute. ``predict()`` now returns "
"ulab ``ndarray``\\ s (not float tuples), supports multi-input models (pass a"
" list), and NMS moved to :mod:`ml.utils`; input normalization moved to "
":class:`ml.preprocessing.Normalization`. The old ``ml.py`` is now "
":mod:`ml.apps`."
msgstr ""
"Modul C TensorFlow ``tf`` ditulis ulang menjadi paket :mod:`ml` yang "
"agnostik terhadap mesin (\\ ``tf`` tetap sebagai alias yang kompatibel ke "
"belakang, tetapi kode baru harus menggunakan :mod:`ml`\\ ). Fungsi tingkat "
"modul ``tf.load``\\ , ``tf.load_builtin_model`` dan metode ``detect()``\\ "
"/\\ ``segment()``\\ /classification dihapus — bangun :class:`ml.Model` dan "
"panggil ``predict()``\\ . ``ml.Model(path)`` kini hanya mengembalikan model "
"(bukan tuple ``(labels, model)``\\ ); label adalah atribut "
"``model.labels``\\ . ``predict()`` kini mengembalikan ``ndarray``\\ ulab "
"(bukan tuple float), mendukung model multi-input (lewatkan daftar), dan NMS "
"dipindahkan ke :mod:`ml.utils`\\ ; normalisasi input dipindahkan ke "
":class:`ml.preprocessing.Normalization`\\ . ``ml.py`` lama kini menjadi "
":mod:`ml.apps`\\ ."

